tegy based on underlying price stability at $686.54, high-probability ~0.16 delta positioning, 5.0-point defined-risk wings, and systematic time decay harvesting despite current environment-level option chain retrieval limitations.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/0458ad2024cca1d0f352aa9d14a176699041a2c3282253fedf1bd0c917f7ccf0-20260923035322840366.json
